{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56604","headline":"敬和裴草然秋晚感时寄张结之作 · 赵志","name":"敬和裴草然秋晚感时寄张结之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱明从律，白藏御时，草腓寒露，木落凉颸。\n有斐君子，感物陈诗。\n义深潘兴，词均宋悲。\n方追逸迹，乃论心期。\n粤惟不敏，滥吹连司。\n庶陪高躅，共采灵芝。\n（按：疑张结、张晧爲一人而抄讹爲二人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}